## Productivity System

_This section documents the task management system (added when productivity module is enabled)._

### Task Tracking
- **`Tasks.md`** — work tasks using Eisenhower matrix
- **`Personal Tasks.md`** — personal tasks using Now / Later / Done

### Weekly Workflow Skills
- **`/week-start`** — Monday: reprioritize matrix, pick #1 thing
- **`/week-close`** — Friday: weekly review, retro, reset
- **`/weekly-status`** — generate exec-level status updates

### Working Notes
- Project-based, not daily notes (e.g. `API Gateway v2 Working Notes.md`)
- Use `type: project` frontmatter
